        "valueString": "Patient reports being more puffed walking to the dining room over the last few months, with shortness of breath mainly on exertion (for example, after approximately 30–40 m along the corridor), settling within a few minutes of rest. No shortness of breath at rest and no clear acute change in the last few days."
