        },
        "valueString": "Patient denies chest pain, palpitations, cough, fever, calf pain or swelling, pleuritic pain, and haemoptysis. Sleeps on two pillows 'just in case'; denies paroxysmal nocturnal dyspnoea. Reports eating and drinking okay."
